        </p>
        <p className="mt-0.5 text-[10px] leading-snug text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
          {typed}
        </p>
        <div className="mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-[9px] font-medium text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
